  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">RECLAIM Sustainability! Europe - Palm Oil</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to influence both public and corporate policies in the areas of value distribution, decent work and natural resources management. 
Specific objectives are: 
European palm oil buyers commit to and implement fair value distribution within their
palm oil supply chain and reward producers for social and environmental performance. (corporate policies)
Within RSPO we lobby for more inclusivity with respect to smallholders and better enforcement by among others a better auditing system and a credible RSPO Complaints and Grievance Mechanism</narrative>
  </description>
